            <div class="rounded-[20px] border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-400">STEP 1</div>
                <div class="mt-2 font-bold text-[16px]">Check your report first</div>
                <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] text-slate-500 leading-6">You have no score but you might have a file. Use annualcreditreport.com — free weekly.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-[20px] border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-400">STEP 2</div>
