                <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] text-slate-500 leading-6">Self reports to all 3 bureaus. 6 months of on-time = +60-100 pts typical.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-[20px] bg-slate-900 text-white p-6">
                <div class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-400">STEP 3</div>
                <div class="mt-2 font-bold text-[16px]">Then apply for small loan</div>
                <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] text-slate-400 leading-6">After 6 months, Upstart approval odds go up 3x. Never borrow more than you can repay in 12 months.</p>
                <a href="/#calculators" class="mt-4 inline-block px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white text-[12px] font-bold">Open Calculator →</a>
