            <p><b class="text-slate-300">© 2026 ScoreUp</b> • Educational only • <a href="/Pages/About" class="underline hover:text-white">About</a> • <a href="/Pages/Privacy" class="underline hover:text-white">Privacy Policy</a> • <a href="/Pages/Contact" class="underline hover:text-white">Contact</a></p>
            <p>Data: Experian, Equifax, CFPB • Ads labeled</p>
